@startuml Google OAuth Login Sequence

actor User
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "Google Auth" as Google
participant "Auth Controller" as AC
participant "Auth Service" as AS
participant "User Repository" as UR
participant "Util" as Util

User -> Browser: Click "Login with Google"
Browser -> Google: Redirect to Google OAuth
Google --> Browser: Authentication page
User -> Google: Enter credentials
Google --> Browser: Authorization code
Browser -> AC: POST /oauth/google (code, state)
AC -> AS: SignInWithGoogle(code, state)
AS -> Util: ParseOAuthStateJWT(state)
Util --> AS: Valid state
AS -> Google: Exchange code for token
Google --> AS: OAuth token
AS -> Google: Get user info
Google --> AS: User profile
AS -> UR: FindByEmail(profile.email)
alt User exists
  UR --> AS: User object
else User doesn't exist
  UR --> AS: Not found
  AS -> UR: Create(new user)
  UR --> AS: Created user
end
AS -> Util: GenerateToken(user)
Util --> AS: JWT token
AS --> AC: Token response
AC --> Browser: 200 OK + token
Browser --> User: Logged in

@enduml
